:: ChobouliFourthSpeech
<div class="speech-box">

# **"ENOUGH!"**

Princess Chouboli EXPLODES from her cushions, unable to bear another second.

**"Why are you both prattling on like fools? The answer is OBVIOUS!"**

Her voice rings through the Golden Palace:

**"The SETHANI was most true! She could have deceived her lord easily! She could have hidden everything! But no—she told the complete truth, knowing it might destroy her marriage!"**

She's breathing hard, eyes blazing with conviction.

**"You don't know how to distinguish between true and false! The sethani's words came from a wife's mouth—and you wouldn't often find such honesty there! SHE was most true!"**

</div>

<p class="drum-text">
<strong>DHAM-DHAMADHAM!  
DHAM-DHAMADHAM!</strong>
</p>

<<set $speechCount to 4>>

<p class="speech-count">
*The unspeaking Chouboli has spoken—FOR THE FOURTH TIME!*
</p>

The silence is deafening.

Then the storyteller cries out with joy:

**"BEAT THE DRUMS TO A GLORIOUS BEAT!"**

[[The story concludes|VictoryEnding]]

<<script>>
  dialogueSound.play();
  shakeSound.play();
  $('#passages').addClass('shake');
  setTimeout(function(){ $('#passages').removeClass('shake'); }, 500);
<</script>>